        <p>
          TheResaleValue's output has three reference points:
        </p>

        <ul class="space-y-3 list-disc pl-6">
          <li><strong class="text-navy-900">Low end:</strong> The quick-sale price. This is what instant-buy platforms or dealers offering spot cash typically pay. It reflects urgency on the seller's side.</li>
