        <p>
          How to use the band depends on the situation. Relocating abroad next month? The low end becomes the realistic benchmark. Willing to list on OLX and field calls for six weeks? The mid-to-high range is targetable. Trading in at a dealership? Expect an offer near or below the low end because the dealer needs margin.
        </p>

